{"title":"Developers","description":"Build on Stirling PDF with the REST API and the Pipeline API, or contribute to the open-source code.","unlisted":false,"space":"developers","layout":"","article":"\n    <h1>Developers</h1>\n<p>Call Stirling PDF tools from your own code on Stirling Cloud or a self-hosted server, or contribute to the project.</p>\n<div class=\"cards cards-2\"><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 18 6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Developers/API/\">REST API</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Base URLs, API keys, curl examples and usage limits.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13 2 4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7l1-8z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Developers/Pipeline-API/\">Pipeline API</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Chain several tools on many files in one request.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6M12 19h8\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Developers/Contributing/\">Contributing</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Run Stirling PDF locally and open a pull request.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p>To let an AI assistant run the tools instead, see <a href=\"/MCP/\">MCP</a>.</p>\n<p>The software Stirling PDF is built on is listed in <a href=\"/Developers/Technologies/\">Open-source components</a>.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Developers/Developers.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"","pager":"<span></span><a class=\"pager-link pager-next\" href=\"/Developers/API/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">Next &rarr;</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">REST API</span>\n      </a>"}